title: "Benchmarking GNN Inference Bottlenecks on Intel Core Ultra NPUs"
abstract: >
  A comprehensive benchmarking framework for evaluating Graph Neural Network (GNN)
  inference on Intel Core Ultra (Meteor Lake) NPUs, comparing against CPU and
  integrated GPU (iGPU) backends under OpenVINO. Covers 14 models (9 GNNs + 5 dense
  baselines), 3 real-world OGB datasets, FP32/INT8 precision analysis, and
  operator-level CPU fallback profiling.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-01"
